    .line 610
    .line 611
    const-string v2, "Fallback applicant data polling that catches updates missed by the websocket.\n\nPolling period in seconds.\nKey: \'periodSec\'. Values: any positive integer\n\nArm a data refresh on the next socket connect when waiting for the connection timed out.\nKey: \'armedRefresh\'. Values: true/false\n\nWait for the socket connection (with a timeout) before executing a request that expects live updates.\nKey: \'waitForConnection\'. Values: true/false\n\nHow long to wait for the socket connection, in milliseconds.\nKey: \'waitTimeoutMs\'. Values: any non-negative integer\n\nHow long the socket stays alive after the last subscriber leaves, in milliseconds.\nKey: \'stopTimeoutMs\'. Values: any non-negative integer"

    .line 612
